<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Untitled Document</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js" id="MathJax-script"></script>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.4;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            background-color: #f9f9f9;
        }
        .document {
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 40px auto;
            padding: 40px 30px;
            background-color: white;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
            border: 1px solid #ddd;
            font-size: 12pt;
        }
        h1, h2, h3 {
            margin-top: 0;
        }
        .header {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }
        .header h1 {
            font-size: 28pt;
            margin: 0;
        }
        .header h2 {
            font-size: 18pt;
            margin: 10px 0 0 0;
        }
        .section {
            margin-bottom: 25px;
        }
        .section h2 {
            font-size: 18pt;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #000;
            padding-bottom: 5px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }
        p, li {
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }
        ul, ol {
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            padding-left: 25px;
        }
        table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            margin: 15px 0;
        }
        th, td {
            border: 1px solid #000;
            padding: 6px 10px;
            text-align: left;
        }
        th {
            background-color: #f0f0f0;
        }
        .placeholder {
            border: 2px dashed #666;
            background-color: #f5f5f5;
            margin: 15px 0;
            text-align: center;
            font-style: italic;
            color: #555;
        }
        .placeholder::before {
            content: "Diagram / Image Placeholder";
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }
        .no-text {
            color: #999;
            font-style: italic;
        }
        @media print {
            body { background: white; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="document">
        <div class="header">
            <h1>Sample Document</h1>
            <h2>Layout Example</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="section">
            <h2>Introduction</h2>
            <p>This document demonstrates the faithful reproduction of an original layout using CSS. All visible text has been extracted verbatim and placed according to the detected spatial structure.</p>
            <p><em>Note: This is a template HTML file. When provided with an actual image, the content would be extracted, columns analyzed, and positions matched precisely.</em></p>
        </div>

        <div class="section">
            <h2>Columns Example</h2>
            <div style="display: flex; gap: 40px; margin: 20px 0;">
                <div style="flex: 1;">
                    <h3>Left Column</h3>
                    <p>Text placed here as if in the first column of a multi-column layout.</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>First item</li>
                        <li>Second item</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
                <div style="flex: 1;">
                    <h3>Right Column</h3>
                    <p>Text placed here as if in the second column.</p>
                    <ol>
                        <li>Numbered item</li>
                        <li>Another numbered item</li>
                    </ol>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="section">
            <h2>Table Layout</h2>
            <table>
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th>Header 1</th>
                        <th>Header 2</th>
                        <th>Header 3</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    <tr>
                        <td>Data row 1</td>
                        <td>Data row 1</td>
                        <td>Data row 1</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td>Data row 2</td>
                        <td>Data row 2</td>
                        <td>Data row 2</td>
                    </tr>
                </tbody>
            </table>
        </div>

        <div class="section">
            <h2>Lists</h2>
            <p>Bulleted list:</p>
            <ul>
                <li>Unordered item one</li>
                <li>Unordered item two</li>
                <li>Unordered item three</li>
            </ul>

            <p>Numbered list:</p>
            <ol>
                <li>First numbered</li>
                <li>Second numbered</li>
                <li>Third numbered</li>
            </ol>
        </div>

        <div class="section">
            <h2>Placeholder for Non-Text Element</h2>
            <div class="placeholder" style="width: 400px; height: 180px;">
                [Diagram: centered diagram or photo at this location]
            </div>
            <p>Text continues below the placeholder exactly as in the original spatial layout.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="section">
            <h2>Address / Block Layout</h2>
            <p style="margin-bottom: 0;">123 Main Street</p>
            <p style="margin-bottom: 0;">Anytown, USA 12345</p>
            <p style="margin-bottom: 0;">Email: example@email.com</p>
        </div>

        <div class="section">
            <h2>Footer / Signature Area</h2>
            <div class="placeholder" style="width: 200px; height: 60px; margin: 10px auto;">
                [Signature / Signature area placeholder]
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
